# Always push to git

After finishing a task that changes the repo, commit and push to `origin` without waiting to be asked.

- Commit only the relevant files; do not skip hooks.
- Do not update git config.
- Do not force-push to main.
- After push, mention the commit and the usual VPS deploy command.
